1
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:06,100
Toyota Center! Houston, light the endgame!

2
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:10,520
Twenty-eighteen! Film-room heads, CALL THE
GAME!

3
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:13,960
HUNT THE SWITCH! Re-screen! Stepback,
BANG!

4
00:00:14,160 --> 00:00:16,720
Tag the roller! Recover! Get a body on
your man!

5
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,680
Every corner three, every lob, every floor
burn!

6
00:00:19,860 --> 00:00:22,480
Clutch City takes the crown! IT'S OUR
TURN!

7
00:00:22,740 --> 00:00:25,340
Sixty-five and seventeen, one-seed,
home-court edge.

8
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:28,200
Mike D'Antoni, spread pick-and-roll,
attack the hedge.

9
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:31,280
Regular-season iso: James Harden, one
point two-two!

10
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:33,680
Chris Paul, one point one-oh points per
iso!

11
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:36,780
Gerald Green takes flight! Luc Mbah a
Moute guards wings!

12
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:39,640
Ryan Anderson stretches! Joe Johnson
posts, swings!

13
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:42,260
Nene seals! Tarik Black, set that screen!

14
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:45,320
Aaron Jackson ready! Chinanu Onuaku with
the team!

15
00:00:45,680 --> 00:00:48,180
Zhou Qi on the bench! Every jersey in the
dream!

16
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:51,060
Minnesota Timberwolves, Jimmy Butler ball
pressure.

17
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:53,620
Karl-Anthony Towns drops! Capela dives!

18
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:56,380
Make him choose! Pull that low man inside!

19
00:00:57,040 --> 00:00:59,580
Harden forty-four in game one! Paint
touch, kick!

20
00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:02,420
Wolves take game three! Don't let the
offense stick!

21
00:01:02,860 --> 00:01:05,340
Game four, FIFTY in the third! Pace off
the board!

22
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:08,240
James twenty-two that quarter! Rim, line,
three, SCORE!

23
00:01:08,420 --> 00:01:10,720
Four-one! Minnesota out! Next scouting
report!

24
00:01:11,160 --> 00:01:13,880
Four-out, one rim runner! Don't clog up
the court!

25
00:01:14,140 --> 00:01:16,720
Utah Jazz, Donovan Mitchell turns the
corner.

26
00:01:17,100 --> 00:01:19,220
Rudy Gobert's rim deterrence, lob-window
disorder.

27
00:01:19,940 --> 00:01:22,880
Game two, Jazz steal home court! Series
one-one!

28
00:01:23,160 --> 00:01:25,420
Paul snakes the high screen, elbow
pull-up, CASH!

29
00:01:25,780 --> 00:01:28,100
Game five: forty-one, ten dimes, zero
turnovers!

30
00:01:28,820 --> 00:01:31,120
Eight for ten from deep! Drop too far?
It's OVER!

31
00:01:31,120 --> 00:01:33,880
Eighty percent three! Seventy-seven point
three!

32
00:01:33,880 --> 00:01:36,720
Effective field goal! Twenty in the
fourth! CP3!

33
00:01:37,020 --> 00:01:39,640
One-twelve, one-oh-two! Four-one! Utah's
done!

34
00:01:39,940 --> 00:01:41,780
That ain't just a box score! That's a
breakthrough!

35
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:44,980
Golden State Warriors! Stephen Curry
relocates!

36
00:01:45,320 --> 00:01:46,640
Kevin Durant shoots over switches!

37
00:01:47,060 --> 00:01:48,460
Klay cuts! Draymond Green creates!

38
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:51,380
They take one, we take two; game three,
forty-one down!

39
00:01:51,780 --> 00:01:53,960
Live-ball turnovers! Runouts! No sound!

40
00:01:54,220 --> 00:01:56,580
Film session! Switch everything! Finish
the possession!

41
00:01:57,160 --> 00:01:59,760
Game four, Harden posters Draymond! PURE
AGGRESSION!

42
00:02:00,280 --> 00:02:02,300
Thirty for James, twenty-seven for Chris!

43
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:05,300
Twelve allowed in the fourth! Contest,
don't foul!

44
00:02:05,660 --> 00:02:08,340
Ninety-five, ninety-two! Series two-two!
Breathe!

45
00:02:08,580 --> 00:02:11,040
Game five, Paul shimmies, splashes over
Steph's reach!

46
00:02:11,380 --> 00:02:13,620
Eric Gordon twenty-four! Bench shot
creation!

47
00:02:14,180 --> 00:02:16,620
Ninety-eight, ninety-four! Three-two!
Elation!

48
00:02:17,040 --> 00:02:19,620
Paul stays on the floor! Stay low! Keep
creating!

49
00:02:19,820 --> 00:02:22,500
Warriors take six! Last game, last stand!

50
00:02:22,900 --> 00:02:25,800
Every possession's leverage! Take it out
their hands!

51
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:31,100
HUNT THE SWITCH! Re-screen! Stepback,
BANG!

52
00:02:31,380 --> 00:02:33,860
Tag the roller! Recover! Get a body on
your man!

53
00:02:34,340 --> 00:02:36,800
Every corner three, every lob, every floor
burn!

54
00:02:36,980 --> 00:02:39,680
Clutch City takes the crown! IT'S OUR
TURN!

55
00:02:39,820 --> 00:02:42,400
Bring Curry's man up! Pre-switch?
Re-screen!

56
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:45,300
Low man tags Capela, Tucker's corner opens
clean!

57
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:48,000
Paul snakes to the nail, pull-up over the
drop!

58
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:51,120
ONE STOP! Chin the rebound! DO NOT LET IT
DROP!

59
00:02:51,340 --> 00:02:53,620
Game seven! Harden thirty-eight, ten
dimes!

60
00:02:54,180 --> 00:02:56,180
Eleven of twenty-three! Six threes! BANG!

61
00:02:56,620 --> 00:02:59,260
Chris twenty-seven, eleven assists, ZERO
gifts!

62
00:02:59,520 --> 00:03:02,140
Four for four at the stripe! NO free
possessions!

63
00:03:02,700 --> 00:03:05,200
P.J. Tucker corner gravity, Trevor Ariza
switches!

64
00:03:05,320 --> 00:03:07,980
Clint Capela vertical spacing! Gordon
lifts!

65
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:10,900
Durant answers! Curry relocates! Nobody
quits!

66
00:03:11,100 --> 00:03:14,000
One-thirteen, one-oh-eight! Four-three!
WEST WON!

67
00:03:14,380 --> 00:03:16,820
Both guards hit the floor crying! Job's
not done!

68
00:03:16,980 --> 00:03:19,560
Cleveland Cavaliers, LeBron James downhill
freight!

69
00:03:19,940 --> 00:03:22,440
Kevin Love pick-and-pop, late weak-side
tag!

70
00:03:22,760 --> 00:03:25,120
They take two! Houston adjusts the tag!

71
00:03:25,460 --> 00:03:28,020
Nail help, kickout, extra pass, rotate
BACK!

72
00:03:28,640 --> 00:03:31,180
Finals game six: Harden FORTY, TEN,
TWELVE!

73
00:03:31,480 --> 00:03:33,640
Triple-double! Six for twelve from deep!
YELL!

74
00:03:33,760 --> 00:03:36,580
Sixty-eight point three true shooting!
EFFICIENT!

75
00:03:36,820 --> 00:03:39,160
Paul twenty-four, twelve dimes! Calm in
the storm!

76
00:03:39,580 --> 00:03:42,180
One-eighteen, one-ten! Four-two! FINAL
HORN!

77
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:44,900
Finals MVP to James, drags the whole team
close!

78
00:03:45,300 --> 00:03:47,860
Rim runs, switches, screens! Every role
gets a toast!

79
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:53,920
Parade through Houston! Rings come later,
let 'em shine!

80
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:56,720
Harden at a Houston strip club! Champagne
shine!

81
00:03:57,020 --> 00:03:59,680
Whole crew at the table, champagne in the
light!

82
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:01,780
From screen assists to banners! WHAT A
NIGHT!

83
00:04:03,420 --> 00:04:05,340
Wolves! Jazz! Warriors! Cavs! Every round
earned!

84
00:04:05,920 --> 00:04:08,280
Harden, Paul, the whole squad! IT'S OUR
TURN!

85
00:04:08,420 --> 00:04:11,080
HUNT THE SWITCH! Final stop! That trophy
comes home!

86
00:04:11,320 --> 00:04:13,780
Clutch City takes the crown! NOBODY DID IT
ALONE!
